{"id":"n41234-1-13","stage":1,"title":"금지 · 禁止","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41234-1-13-1","ko":"나와서 같이 놀자.","zh":"出来一起玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나와서","meaning":"出，走出","explanation":"나오다：出，走出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"13","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와서","audio":"/audio/0fa3938955583182ca19.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"놀자.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀자","audio":"/audio/427799fc27c8f312f572.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，走出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"脱离某处。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/96ce84b4e6ae4a147892.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41234-1-13-2","ko":"나 일주일 동안 외출 금지라서 밖에 못 나가.","zh":"这周我被禁止外出，出不了门。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"일주일","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期。","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间。","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"외출","meaning":"外出，出行，出门","explanation":"외출：外出，出行，出门。","readings":[{"term":"외출","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67857","senseId":"1","lemma":"외출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외출","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"금지라서","meaning":"禁止","explanation":"금지：禁止；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"금지","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41234","senseId":"1","lemma":"금지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금지라서","audio":"/audio/b97e754e621f42cd71f8.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外面","explanation":"밖에 是 밖“外面”加位置助词 에；这里指屋外，不是“只有……”。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"나가.","meaning":"出门","explanation":"나가다 在这里是从家里走出去；因为被禁止外出而无法出门。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가","audio":"/audio/2ea9b6f2f116b0039a33.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d7137afeb52708a5","term":"일주일","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3","entryId":"30189","definition":"从周一开始到周日的七天；或指一周。","pronunciation":["일쭈일"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"b39546a26046f3d2","term":"외출","zh":"外出，出行，出门","audio":"/audio/b39546a26046f3d2c5d6.mp3","entryId":"67857","definition":"有事要干从家里或公司等地出去。","pronunciation":["외ː출","웨ː출"]},{"id":"c019e0d89b7506f2","term":"금지","zh":"禁止","audio":"/audio/c019e0d89b7506f26a52.mp3","entryId":"41234","definition":"以法律、条例或命令的形式不允许做某种行为。","pronunciation":["금ː지"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"家或房间等空间之外；本句指被禁止出门。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e6a048bb3883614a607.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41234","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceSco